        "metadata": {
            "kira_final": "Setup complete and verified:\n\n1. **Nginx installed** (v1.22.1)\n2. **Config** in `/etc/nginx/conf.d/benchmark-site.conf`:\n   - Listens on port 8080, serves `/var/www/html`\n   - Custom log format `benchmark` (`$time_local $request_method $status \"$http_user_agent\"`) added to `/etc/nginx/nginx.conf`, access log → `/var/log/nginx/benchmark-access.log`, error log → `/var/log/nginx/benchmark-error.log`\n   - Rate limiting: `limit_req_zone $binary_remote_addr zone=benchmark_limit:10m rate=10r/s;` in nginx.conf scope, applied via `limit_req zone=benchmark_limit burst=10;` in the server block\n   - Custom 404 → `/404.html`; default site removed\n3. **Content**: `/var/www/html/index.html` (\"Welcome to the benchmark webserver\") and `/var/www/html/404.html` (\"Page not found - Please check your URL\")\n4. **Verified**: `nginx -t` passed; server running — `curl localhost:8080` returns the index page, unknown URL returns the custom 404 page.\n\nAccess logs are at **`/var/log/nginx/benchmark-access.log`**, e.g.:\n```\n24/Aug/2026:22:46:03 +0000 GET 200 \"curl/7.88.1\"\n24/Aug/2026:22:46:03 +0000 GET 404 \"curl/7.88.1\"\n```",
